        "created_at": "2017-08-16T14:22:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>First, awesome costumes! I knew who you were right off the bat, and that's always a good thing when it comes to cosplay.</p><p>I'm curious though, will the convention let you bring in the bat? Or is it just a whiffle-ball bat painted over, and so it's okay?</p>",
