        "raw": "<p>First, awesome costumes! I knew who you were right off the bat, and that&#39;s always a good thing when it comes to cosplay.</p><p>I&#39;m curious though, will the convention let you bring in the bat? Or is it just a whiffle-ball bat painted over, and so it&#39;s okay?</p>",
